old_title = "A coat of mail too big"
level = 2
summary = "THE ROAD SOUTH. ZAMPANO WEARS A COAT OF MAIL TWO SIZES TOO BIG AND STILL HAS NO ARMS. JACK AND TWO LADS OF THE ROAD WANT WHAT THE ARMOURER DROPPED: BARK THEM OFF. THEN PICK UP A SWORD, A BELT AND A SHIELD PAINTED LAST NIGHT, TRY A CHARGE, AND SPAR WITH THE SQUIRES OF PIERRE D'AMIENS, HIS LORD. CONFUSIONE IS ALEAUME, A CLERK WHO CALLS HIM BROTHER."
